GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 672.45(1.1) the court must send the transcript, documents and exhibits to the Review Board without delay` MEANS
    IF `the court does not hold a hearing under subsection 672.45(1)` AND `the transcript, document, information or exhibits are in its possession`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If the court does not hold a hearing under subsection (1)"

-- 672.45(2): at a disposition hearing, the court shall make a disposition in respect of the accused, if it is satisfied that it can readily do so and that a disposition should be made without delay.
-- fork: F-DUTY-GATE
